{
  "status": "Benchmark scopes qualified: 59 existing timing cases retained with 47 method bodies unchanged; four tracked-storage scenarios move to explicit untimed JSON and three prepared-scene raster cases are added. All 62 generated workloads compile on both hosts/targets; untimed pixels, sink equivalence, input immutability and lifecycle checks pass. No timed benchmark execution or renderer performance claim.",
