  "engineeringFinding": "Returning PeakBytes from a Benchmark method times the encoding/snapshot operation; it does not export that return value as a memory metric. Allocation traffic and tracked storage need separate observations. Full-conversion scene cases retain only input bytes; one parsed root is owned by each targeted raster setup and disposed after it finishes.",
